// Golden canonical-genesis ConfigParam30 leaves for Simplex protocol v2: the
// masterchain leaf, then the shard leaf.
// Keep this encoding synchronized with crypto/smartcont/gen-zerostate.fif.
// The local test harness (test/tostester/src/tostester/zerostate.py) keeps
// its own defaults (1000 ms first_block_timeout, one leaf for both chains).

"Config.fif" include

dictnew
<b 400 32 u, b> <s 0 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 700 32 u, b> <s 1 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 250 32 u, b> <s 10 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 300 32 u, b> <s 13 rot 8 udict! drop
<b x{22} s, 0 5 u, 2 2 u, 1 1 u, 4 32 u, swap dict, b>

hashu 0x131A33C486174558385E855E497FCD8039019F82E43BE9DB953087FFF6C03457
= not abort"unexpected Simplex v2 masterchain genesis cell hash"

dictnew
<b 400 32 u, b> <s 0 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 700 32 u, b> <s 1 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 64 32 u, b> <s 10 rot 8 udict! drop
<b 300 32 u, b> <s 13 rot 8 udict! drop
<b x{22} s, 0 5 u, 2 2 u, 1 1 u, 16 32 u, swap dict, b>

hashu 0x8C97884D0AD8EA682D704782C056F846C33D57777FC01AD90C0F24E2B90E0B09
= not abort"unexpected Simplex v2 shard genesis cell hash"
